？"},{"english":"who's that?","chinese":"是谁啊？"},{"english":"is that John?","chinese":"那是约翰吗？"}]},{"id":"that:o:4ec64a2451aa","label":"pron.","definitionZh":"那种","glossesEn":["categorizing person or thing"],"registers":["formal"],"examples":[{"english":"salaries are higher here than those in my country","chinese":"这儿的薪水比我们国家的高"}]},{"id":"that:o:ee65e3368cd6","label":"pron.","definitionZh":"那样","glossesEn":["indeed"],"registers":["informal"],"examples":[{"english":"he's a fussy man — he is that","chinese":"他是个挑剔的人──的确如此"}]},{"id":"that:o:db972fb5470e","label":"rel. pron.","definitionZh":"引导限定性定语从句","glossesEn":["introducing defining clause"],"examples":[{"english":"the house that they bought","chinese":"他们买的房子"},{"english":"the woman that won","chinese":"获胜的那个女人"},{"english":"and fool that I am, I believed him","chinese":"我真傻，竟然相信了他"}]},{"id":"that:o:2e4829295836","label":"rel. pron.","definitionZh":"代替for which, in which, when引导定语从句","glossesEn":["for which, in which, when"],"examples":[{"english":"the reason that I phoned","chinese":"我打电话的原因"},{"english":"the way that she works","chinese":"她的工作方式"},{"english":"the night that she arrived","chinese":"她到达的那晚"}]},{"id":"that:o:7d715da9aadc","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"引导表示陈述、假设、原因、结果、目的的从句","glossesEn":["expressing statement or hypothesis, reason or cause, result, purpose"],"examples":[{"english":"he said that he had finished","chinese":"他说他已经完成了"},{"english":"it's likely that they are out","chinese":"他们很可能出去了"},{"english":"it's important that they should realize","chinese":"重要的是他们应当意识到"}]},{"id":"that:o:6c91613a46e2","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"竟然","glossesEn":["expressing surprise"],"examples":[{"english":"that it should come to this!","chinese":"事情怎么会这样啊！"},{"english":"that she should treat me so badly!","chinese":"她怎么能如此恶劣地对待我！"}]},{"id":"that:o:dab080e9e4b9","label":"conj.","definitionZh":"要是…就好了","glossesEn":["expressing wish"],"registers":["literary"],"examples":[{"english":"oh that I could fly!","chinese"